  "description": "Strongly typed C# OpenSTAAD wrapper for Bentley STAAD.Pro automation on Windows .NET 9 (.NET Core). Provides session attachment/acquisition with process and model identity checks, metadata and model/path/process observations, and model/application operations with XML IntelliSense. This preview supplies 53 common Root contracts and three optional Root operations and wrapper foundations. Requires installed, licensed STAAD.Pro; Load metadata/envelope/ordinary-combination definitions and Output availability/member-end force/buckling/steel-design/support-reaction, static-check and plate-center moment/surface-stress composite, corner-force and cut-line resultant queries are implemented; other domain adapters are binding-only placeholders. Developer resources include Marketplace installation links for the optional StruXllence VS Code dark and light themes in the packaged README.",
  "iconFile": "images/symbol-only-logo-core.png",
