  "releaseNotes": "Ported pointwise plate stress and four offset-aware member-end and physical-joint overloads. Qualified the 32-component stress packet, resolved global offsets and transferred face moments to their incidence joints under one owning-thread operation. Output provides 85 contracts with matching XML IntelliSense.",
